cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these shapes, data or code, please cite the companion paper below and arXiv:2607.15251."
title: "exact-collider: exact bispectra in strongly mixed multifield inflation (explorer, data and code)"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Tree-level primordial bispectra of the effective field theory of inflationary fluctuations extended
  by a massive isocurvature scalar, with the curvature-isocurvature mixing resummed to all orders:
  an in-browser explorer of the six shapes, the raw tables of the companion paper with its comparison
  to Planck PR4, and two Python modules, with an example notebook, that compute the shapes.
authors:
